[Unit]
Description=GAZBOT V7 — log PX/CVD GAP episodes for the pre-registered forward test (READ-ONLY)
# ★★★ WHY IT EXISTS: the operator asked for worked examples of the PX·CVD pair and produced 65·10 —
# a 55-point disagreement the SHIPPED rule IGNORES, because bearish needs px>=85 and bullish needs
# px<=15. The widest divergence of the four he named gets no colour at all. He found the hole by
# asking for examples; no test had.
# ⚠ Pre-registered in data/prereg_gap_rolling.json. The threshold 35 is NOT FITTED — it is the minimum gap
# the incumbent rule already implies (85/50 and 15/50 are both 35), so no number was chosen by
# looking at data. DO NOT TUNE IT; a change restarts the count at zero.
# ⚠ The unit of observation is an EPISODE, never a minute — a gap persists for many minutes and
# counting them would score one divergence forty times.
After=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=alphabot
Environment=PYTHONPATH=src
WorkingDirectory=/home/alphabot/gazbot7
MemoryMax=300M
TimeoutStartSec=120
ExecStart=/home/alphabot/gazbot7/.venv/bin/python scripts/gap_log.py
SuccessExitStatus=0 1
